### Summary

Updated the Jenkins alerts SNS configuration to use direct email notifications without relying on Amazon SES.

### Changes

- Removed the SES email identity and associated subscription dependency.
- Removed SES from the Jenkins alerts SNS topic policy.
- Retained the direct email subscription to imac@oig.hhs.gov.
- Added the required CloudWatch alarm permissions to the SNS KMS key policy.
- Preserved the existing Jenkins notification subscriptions and department-based filtering.

### Verification Plan

Deploy the changes to DEV, verify that the SNS email subscription is confirmed, publish a test notification, and confirm successful email delivery to the IMAC mailbox before deploying to PROD.
